          <style>Title</style>
          <text>Audio v0.09 - LV on grace notes</text>
        </Text>
        <Text>
          <style>Subtitle</style>
          <size>10</size>
          <text>Modern FluidSynth: before-grace C/E, after-grace D/F, a marked grace within a group, and a final after-grace A.
Marked grace notes should ring through the following measure; the final hold ends with the score.
Compare live playback and WAV/MIDI export; stop/seek during a hold. LV is channel-wide.</text>
        </Text>
